# Typography

Catalog: [`docs/md/typography.md`](../../docs/md/typography.md). Licenses: [`CREDITS.md`](../../CREDITS.md).

## Catalog is local

Faces live under `webroot/vendor/fonts/`. Overlay and Overlay Stage import `overlay.css`. Landing and the docs site import `ui.css` (Better VCR + Geist). Admin stays Geist-only.

- Quote family names and always give a generic fallback: `font-family: 'Better VCR', sans-serif`.
- `font-display: swap`. Never block paint waiting for a font.
- Adding a face: folder + `family.css`, `@import` from `overlay.css`, row in Typography and Credits, then name it on a theme in overlay CSS.
- Append. Do not shuffle the catalog for fun.

## Overlay themes

These assignments live in `webroot/overlay/style.css`. New themes may name any catalog family there. Overlay Stage has no font selector and no persisted font index. Do not add one.

| Theme | Face |
|-------|------|
| LCD Glass | Better VCR |
| Lower Third | Geist |
| Amber Terminal | Better VCR |

Landing / Stage / docs headings stay Better VCR. Body chrome stays Geist.
